# Tor configuration — OpenClaw P2P Node
# Symmetry Labs Infrastructure

# ── SOCKS5 proxy ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
SocksPolicy accept 172.16.0.0/12
SocksPolicy reject *

# ── Hidden service (agent P2P port) ──────────────────────────────────────────
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/hidden_service
HiddenServicePort 8765 agent:8765

# ── Data / logging ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout

# ── Security hardening ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AvoidDiskWrites 1
DisableDebuggerAttachment 1
HardwareAccel 0
SafeLogging 1

# ── Circuit tuning ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MaxCircuitDirtiness 600
NewCircuitPeriod 30
NumEntryGuards 3
